#: e5dc21464fac4468ad4df12876c1bc1b
msgid "V2 Version"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-heewingf405.rst:172
#: e805876300a54c7f8c324cbc55f52a29
msgid "The upcoming V2 version with internal flash logging should ship with a correct bootloader with ArduPilot firmware installed. Updating firmware can be done normally with Mission Planner or other GCS."
msgstr ""

